1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,140
Well, look at that. We've finally made it.

2
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:10,180
Ugh, finally is right. It's always tough to find gentlemanly companionship on the road.

3
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:32,840
All right. I'm off to meet this genus person in administration. What are you doing the rest of the day?

4
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,840
I think I'll be joining you.

5
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:38,140
Oh, yeah? Are you interested in studying here?

6
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:43,180
No, but I am extremely interested in the student body.

7
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:45,240
Of course, yeah.

8
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:50,660
On the journey here, Alina Lise revealed to me that her promiscuity is due in large part to a curse.

9
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:56,020
If she doesn't get any for a little too long, her health will rapidly deteriorate.

10
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:58,220
Guess we should be on our way, then.

11
00:02:33,010 --> 00:02:50,010
Thank you for waiting. I am Genus, the vice-principal here.

12
00:02:50,670 --> 00:02:53,090
It's a pleasure to meet you. I'm Rudeus Greyrat.

13
00:02:53,590 --> 00:02:57,930
And my name is Alina Lise Dragonroad. I'm a member of Rudeus' party.

14
00:02:58,350 --> 00:03:02,490
I have to admit, I didn't think we would get to welcome you so soon.

15
00:03:02,490 --> 00:03:04,950
Well, I was advised to come quickly.

16
00:03:05,630 --> 00:03:08,470
Were you? Oh, yes. By Roxy, I suppose.

17
00:03:08,950 --> 00:03:10,950
That's Ms. Roxy to you, asshole.

18
00:03:11,330 --> 00:03:16,310
In any case, I take it you intend to enroll? What is it that you would like to accomplish here?

19
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:21,270
A number of things. I have some research I'd like to do. Magic's still to learn.

20
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:23,970
I just decided this was the right place to do it.

21
00:03:24,510 --> 00:03:26,570
I'm glad to hear you answer honestly.

22
00:03:26,570 --> 00:03:32,950
But now, if you wouldn't mind, I would ask your cooperation as we administer a little test.

23
00:03:32,950 --> 00:03:34,710
What kind of test?

24
00:03:36,410 --> 00:03:41,050
The grounds go on forever. Do you really have that many students enrolled here?

25
00:03:41,870 --> 00:03:46,170
Yes, we cater to all. Unlike most magically-focused academies,

26
00:03:46,410 --> 00:03:50,330
Runaway University offers programs in non-magical disciplines as well.

27
00:03:50,330 --> 00:03:57,170
Really? Would those programs by any chance include a medical course that handles the study of mental illness?

28
00:03:57,790 --> 00:04:04,170
I've never heard of a medical course in mental illness, but we do offer classes in healing, detoxification magic,

29
00:04:04,330 --> 00:04:06,930
and we have a department for the study of curses.

30
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:10,550
Why do you inquire? Is someone you know sick?

31
00:04:10,550 --> 00:04:13,510
Well, yeah, I guess you could say that.

32
00:04:14,350 --> 00:04:19,470
I understand. We have many students who have enrolled to research cures and the like for their loved ones.

33
00:04:20,170 --> 00:04:21,110
A noble pursuit.

34
00:04:24,110 --> 00:04:27,170
Okay, so what exactly would you like me to do?

35
00:04:27,470 --> 00:04:31,070
I understand that you've mastered spellcasting without incantations.

36
00:04:31,450 --> 00:04:32,830
I would like for you to demonstrate.

37
00:04:34,190 --> 00:04:38,410
I've arranged for our resident silentcaster to help us verify your abilities.

38
00:04:38,410 --> 00:04:42,850
One of our brightest students. This is Fitz.

39
00:04:51,130 --> 00:04:54,490
Oh, it's a pleasure to meet you. I'm Rudeus Greyrat.

40
00:04:54,930 --> 00:04:58,230
Provided this goes well, I'll be your underclassman this coming semester.

41
00:04:58,570 --> 00:05:01,570
And if you find me lacking in any way, I hope you'll help guide me along.

42
00:05:02,930 --> 00:05:06,730
Um, sure. I'm Fitz. Pleasure.

43
00:05:06,730 --> 00:05:12,950
Your test today will be a mock duel. With primarily voiceless magic, if you please.

44
00:05:13,930 --> 00:05:14,630
Yes, sir.

45
00:05:16,710 --> 00:05:19,690
Wait. If I lose, is he gonna make me pay tuition?

46
00:05:20,350 --> 00:05:23,290
That would suck. I don't want to do that.

47
00:05:26,430 --> 00:05:27,370
Cute wand.

48
00:05:27,370 --> 00:05:29,570
Now, begin!

49
00:05:35,570 --> 00:05:37,390
Really? But how?

50
00:05:37,950 --> 00:05:38,990
Good question.

51
00:05:39,350 --> 00:05:39,970
No wonder.

52
00:05:39,970 --> 00:05:51,210
I have to know.

53
00:05:51,790 --> 00:05:53,190
How did you do that?

54
00:05:53,810 --> 00:05:55,690
That was just a disturbed magic spell.

55
00:05:56,250 --> 00:05:57,070
Do you not know it?

56
00:05:59,070 --> 00:06:00,010
Aw, man.

57
00:06:00,630 --> 00:06:03,030
Did I just publicly embarrass an upperclassman?

58
00:06:03,030 --> 00:06:12,670
Thank you for going so easy on me.

59
00:06:13,230 --> 00:06:16,830
You didn't have to let me win just because I'm new here, but I do appreciate it.

60
00:06:21,630 --> 00:06:24,470
Soft hands. He's probably never held a weapon.

61
00:06:24,470 --> 00:06:33,210
Hey, I really do owe you one, so I'll find some way to pay you back for this soon.

62
00:06:33,210 --> 00:06:40,250
And so, a month later, I was living in the university dorms.

63
00:06:40,850 --> 00:06:44,270
I also got a better breakdown of what being a special student means.

64
00:06:44,830 --> 00:06:49,350
We're exempt from paying tuition, and we're excused from most, if not all, regular lessons.

65
00:06:49,710 --> 00:06:54,430
As long as I attend a homeroom meeting once a month, I can pretty much do whatever I want here.

66
00:06:54,930 --> 00:06:57,630
We're treated more like research staff than regular students.

67
00:06:57,630 --> 00:07:01,330
And we're obviously still ambassadors for the school when we're off campus.

68
00:07:01,790 --> 00:07:04,490
But it's almost more freedom than I know what to do with.

69
00:07:11,050 --> 00:07:12,490
Well, how do I look?

70
00:07:13,110 --> 00:07:17,770
I bet you'd have an even easier time picking up guys around here if you shortened your skirt a little bit.

71
00:07:18,090 --> 00:07:19,750
Just long enough to hide your underwear.

72
00:07:20,550 --> 00:07:23,150
Yeah, I suppose I could, but what if I get too cold?

73
00:07:23,570 --> 00:07:25,870
Then just wear stockings up to your thighs.

74
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:30,370
But of course, just what I'd expect from your brilliant intellect.

75
00:07:31,990 --> 00:07:35,830
And now, a few words from the student council president.

76
00:07:40,330 --> 00:07:41,810
Isn't that Princess Ariel?

77
00:07:42,470 --> 00:07:45,390
It is. So that must be silent bits.

78
00:07:46,010 --> 00:07:47,630
Oh, it's Master Luke.

79
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:53,630
My goodness, isn't that the same sweet little boy you brought to tears during your exhibition battle?

80
00:07:53,630 --> 00:07:55,950
Don't say it like that. I didn't make him cry.

81
00:07:56,810 --> 00:07:59,870
Silence! Princess Ariel wishes to speak.

82
00:08:00,130 --> 00:08:01,470
Oh, he's pretty.

83
00:08:01,910 --> 00:08:04,250
He kind of reminds me of Paul.

84
00:08:04,510 --> 00:08:05,730
The floor is yours, Your Highness.

85
00:08:05,730 --> 00:08:10,170
I am Aria Onomoi Asura.

86
00:08:10,170 --> 00:08:16,370
I'm the second princess of the Asura Kingdom and leader of this university student council.

87
00:08:17,330 --> 00:08:22,370
You have made the pilgrimage to the Rinoa University of Magic from around the world and all walks of life.

88
00:08:22,370 --> 00:08:29,210
Our student body is made up of many different clans and races, from humans to demons and beast folk.

89
00:08:29,830 --> 00:08:33,110
Language and cultural barriers between students may feel daunting.

90
00:08:33,590 --> 00:08:40,910
However, you would do well to remember you mustn't persecute your fellow students, simply because their race or speech is different.

91
00:08:40,910 --> 00:08:50,390
Let's all follow the rules, don't make anyone uncomfortable, all pretty standard initiation kind of stuff.

92
00:08:50,930 --> 00:08:55,150
It would normally bore me, but she's got real charisma.

93
00:08:55,930 --> 00:08:58,150
I just want to listen to her.

94
00:08:59,090 --> 00:09:05,350
And finally, we welcome you with open arms and wish you pleasant and enriching lives here.

95
00:09:05,350 --> 00:09:15,030
Crap!

96
00:09:15,530 --> 00:09:18,470
I forgot to do something nice for that guy after the test.

97
00:09:19,310 --> 00:09:20,970
Please don't hold that against me.

98
00:09:29,370 --> 00:09:32,670
Uh, is this the special student class?

99
00:09:35,350 --> 00:09:45,530
Master!

100
00:09:45,530 --> 00:09:47,530
Master!

101
00:09:47,530 --> 00:10:01,030
Tell me you haven't forgotten your student!

102
00:10:01,030 --> 00:10:02,530
It is I, Zanuba!

103
00:10:02,530 --> 00:10:04,970
Uh, nope, of course I remember you!

104
00:10:05,170 --> 00:10:07,770
Please let go, my pupil, you're scaring me a little.

105
00:10:08,150 --> 00:10:09,510
How are you, master?

106
00:10:10,250 --> 00:10:12,710
Well, right now, I'm glad to find your highness and good-

107
00:10:12,710 --> 00:10:13,010
No!

108
00:10:15,710 --> 00:10:17,350
I don't like him, Meow.

109
00:10:18,070 --> 00:10:18,290
Huh?

110
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:18,870
Meow?

111
00:10:20,210 --> 00:10:23,690
But Mistress Lenia, this is the young man I was telling you about before.

112
00:10:24,050 --> 00:10:24,390
My master-

113
00:10:24,390 --> 00:10:25,210
Bring him here, Meow.

114
00:10:25,210 --> 00:10:26,210
Uh, well-

115
00:10:26,210 --> 00:10:27,930
Hang on, is he getting bullied?

116
00:10:28,450 --> 00:10:32,310
I thought Zanuba was pretty strong, but can't deny what it looks like.

117
00:10:32,310 --> 00:10:35,430
It's a pleasure to meet you.

118
00:10:35,810 --> 00:10:37,230
My name is Rudeus Greyrat.

119
00:10:37,590 --> 00:10:39,330
I'm honored to be joining your class.

120
00:10:39,730 --> 00:10:43,150
Either way, acting humble is the way to go with people like her.

121
00:10:43,670 --> 00:10:46,130
Then I can just avoid her as best I can.

122
00:10:46,130 --> 00:10:49,990
Wow, I like that you know your place, Meow.

123
00:10:50,450 --> 00:10:51,950
Name's Lenia de Doldia.

124
00:10:52,310 --> 00:10:53,250
I'm a fifth year.

125
00:10:53,930 --> 00:10:57,550
And my dad, Gaius, he's the warchief of Doldia Village, Meow.

126
00:10:57,830 --> 00:10:59,470
So you had better watch your step.

127
00:11:00,150 --> 00:11:02,090
I figured she was a Doldia.

128
00:11:02,730 --> 00:11:04,050
But Gaius' daughter?

129
00:11:04,570 --> 00:11:06,670
He did say his oldest was studying abroad.

130
00:11:06,990 --> 00:11:08,510
I guess now I know where.

131
00:11:09,350 --> 00:11:09,830
Memories.

132
00:11:10,330 --> 00:11:10,850
Ah, blue.

133
00:11:10,850 --> 00:11:15,530
It stinks in here.

134
00:11:18,650 --> 00:11:20,970
Excuse me, we haven't been introduced yet either.

135
00:11:21,170 --> 00:11:22,450
May I ask your name as well?

136
00:11:23,850 --> 00:11:24,910
It's Persina.

137
00:11:25,390 --> 00:11:27,350
My deal is the same as Lina's.

138
00:11:27,870 --> 00:11:28,690
Persina, huh?

139
00:11:29,150 --> 00:11:30,790
That's a really beautiful name.

140
00:11:31,010 --> 00:11:31,710
Glad to meet you.

141
00:11:32,550 --> 00:11:33,490
No need not know.

142
00:11:34,490 --> 00:11:34,890
Uh.

143
00:11:40,850 --> 00:11:42,910
Hey.

144
00:11:44,010 --> 00:11:44,530
Yes?

145
00:11:44,830 --> 00:11:45,590
Can I help you?

146
00:11:45,830 --> 00:11:46,830
Just double-checking.

147
00:11:47,070 --> 00:11:48,850
You said your name was Rudeus, that right?

148
00:11:49,390 --> 00:11:49,790
Yes.

149
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:51,970
Rudeus Greyrat at your service.

150
00:11:52,490 --> 00:11:54,110
It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

151
00:11:56,110 --> 00:11:57,310
I'm Cliff Grimoire.

152
00:11:57,590 --> 00:11:58,810
I'm a magical genius.

153
00:11:59,690 --> 00:12:01,750
He calls himself a genius?

154
00:12:02,490 --> 00:12:03,690
That's not embarrassing.

155
00:12:03,690 --> 00:12:08,750
I'm a second year, but I've already achieved advanced rankings in all offensive magics.

156
00:12:09,150 --> 00:12:11,950
As well as healing, detoxification, and divine magic.

157
00:12:12,470 --> 00:12:14,950
I'm a beginner with barriers, but I'll be intermediate soon.

158
00:12:16,130 --> 00:12:18,390
Wow, that's really impressive.

159
00:12:19,450 --> 00:12:20,750
Don't be so effusive.

160
00:12:21,830 --> 00:12:23,310
I know you're a mage, of course.

161
00:12:23,830 --> 00:12:25,330
But you're a swordsman too, right?

162
00:12:25,850 --> 00:12:28,750
Yes, though I only dabble nowadays.

163
00:12:29,470 --> 00:12:30,890
But how do you know that?

164
00:12:31,170 --> 00:12:32,730
Who told you that I was a swordsman?

165
00:12:32,730 --> 00:12:35,130
Eris did.

166
00:12:37,050 --> 00:12:37,570
Eris?

167
00:12:39,390 --> 00:12:41,110
Is she enrolled here too?

168
00:12:41,550 --> 00:12:42,030
Really?

169
00:12:42,570 --> 00:12:43,810
No, of course she isn't.

170
00:12:44,730 --> 00:12:45,490
Yeah, fair.

171
00:12:46,110 --> 00:12:48,810
There's no way in hell Eris would go back to school now.

172
00:12:50,010 --> 00:12:53,370
So, um, where exactly did you cross paths?

173
00:12:58,190 --> 00:13:00,770
And now there's only one of us you haven't met yet.

174
00:13:00,770 --> 00:13:03,350
Although, she may not come by at all.

175
00:13:03,610 --> 00:13:05,090
So she doesn't attend classes?

176
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:06,510
Nope.

177
00:13:07,010 --> 00:13:10,610
And as you can see, she's even exempt from our monthly homeroom meetings.

178
00:13:10,990 --> 00:13:14,090
She spends the vast majority of her time in her research laboratory.

179
00:13:14,090 --> 00:13:18,270
Well, in that case, whatever she's researching must be huge.

180
00:13:19,570 --> 00:13:22,570
Oh, but of course she ventures outside when she needs to.

181
00:13:22,770 --> 00:13:24,330
I'm sure you'll meet her eventually.

182
00:13:24,330 --> 00:13:28,150
You want to hang out later?

183
00:13:28,290 --> 00:13:29,350
I still have homework.

184
00:13:29,350 --> 00:13:41,770
Well, the man god said if I want to get my mojo back, I need to investigate the displacement incident.

185
00:13:41,770 --> 00:13:50,410
All right.

186
00:13:50,790 --> 00:13:55,670
The man-god said if I want to get my mojo back, I need to investigate the displacement incident.

187
00:13:56,030 --> 00:13:56,730
I can do that.

188
00:13:57,590 --> 00:13:58,990
This library is gigantic.

189
00:14:03,250 --> 00:14:05,530
But that kind of makes it difficult to start.

190
00:14:11,770 --> 00:14:17,010
Please forgive me for the other day.

191
00:14:17,330 --> 00:14:20,110
I was overzealous with my magic and caused you to lose face.

192
00:14:20,470 --> 00:14:24,410
I intended to bring you a gift of some kind in repayment, but I haven't quite found the chance yet.

193
00:14:24,690 --> 00:14:25,730
But the next time I see you, I-

194
00:14:25,730 --> 00:14:26,050
It's fine.

195
00:14:26,370 --> 00:14:27,550
And you don't have to bow.

196
00:14:28,770 --> 00:14:31,190
Um, Rudeus, was it?

197
00:14:31,610 --> 00:14:32,890
What brings you to the library?

198
00:14:33,510 --> 00:14:34,710
Just a bit of research.

199
00:14:35,670 --> 00:14:36,790
Oh? Into what?

200
00:14:37,050 --> 00:14:38,470
The mass teleportation.

201
00:14:38,850 --> 00:14:39,290
Really?

202
00:14:40,390 --> 00:14:40,790
Why?

203
00:14:40,790 --> 00:14:47,650
Well, I grew up in and around the Fatoa region of Asura myself, but the incident teleported me to the middle of the Demon Continent.

204
00:14:48,330 --> 00:14:49,230
Demon Continent?

205
00:14:50,070 --> 00:14:53,510
Yes. The journey home took just about three years.

206
00:14:54,030 --> 00:14:59,130
My family all seems to have been found in that time, but as far as I know, one of my old friends is still missing.

207
00:15:00,030 --> 00:15:03,610
And you came here to investigate where they might have wound up?

208
00:15:04,030 --> 00:15:04,850
Yes, I did.

209
00:15:05,950 --> 00:15:09,650
Yeah, let's stick with that instead of jumping straight to erectile dysfunction.

210
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:14,310
But I mean, I do want to learn more about the Mana disaster, too.

211
00:15:14,990 --> 00:15:17,490
I see. You really are incredible.

212
00:15:18,650 --> 00:15:21,590
I should be going. See you around, Rudeus.

213
00:15:21,590 --> 00:15:23,610
Oh, yeah. See you.

214
00:15:26,170 --> 00:15:26,650
Oh.

215
00:15:27,970 --> 00:15:32,490
For your research, Rude Animus is exploring the teleporter labyrinth.

216
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:36,450
It is a narrative account, but it's a good place to start.

217
00:15:37,450 --> 00:15:38,650
Thank you very much.

218
00:15:38,650 --> 00:15:45,370
That was really kind, and he honestly doesn't seem to be holding a grudge after that mock battle.

219
00:15:45,810 --> 00:15:49,270
Maybe the tough guy Shades threw me off, and he's actually a pretty great guy.

220
00:15:50,270 --> 00:15:53,130
Oh. So your highness is here studying abroad?

221
00:15:53,670 --> 00:15:56,750
Yes. And I practice my earth magic every day.

222
00:15:57,610 --> 00:16:01,510
Is that so? Then once I'm settled, let's make a figure together.

223
00:16:02,490 --> 00:16:02,930
Yes!

224
00:16:03,790 --> 00:16:07,470
Oh, uh, should I address you as royalty or just an upperclassman?

225
00:16:09,090 --> 00:16:11,990
Please, we needn't bother with titles at all, dear master.

226
00:16:12,150 --> 00:16:15,810
Far be it for me to tell you what to do, but you are free to simply call me Zanoba.

227
00:16:16,630 --> 00:16:17,310
Zanoba, then.

228
00:16:17,890 --> 00:16:18,290
Master!

229
00:16:18,290 --> 00:16:28,290
You. Aren't you Fitz's...

230
00:16:28,290 --> 00:16:31,630
Nice to meet you. My name is Rudeus Greyrat.

231
00:16:32,070 --> 00:16:36,030
It's my first day as a student here, so I'll be looking to you upperclassmen for guidance.

232
00:16:36,470 --> 00:16:41,470
Yes, I'm aware. Fitz said as much. And that you're rather forgetful.

233
00:16:42,510 --> 00:16:45,570
Forgetful? Me? What does he think I'm forgetting?

234
00:16:45,570 --> 00:16:48,890
Anyway, you do know who I am, don't you?

235
00:16:49,930 --> 00:16:54,970
No, actually, I'm afraid I don't, but if you would be so kind as to introduce yourself...

236
00:16:54,970 --> 00:16:58,930
I shouldn't be surprised that I'm beneath your notice. Even so...

237
00:16:58,930 --> 00:17:00,390
I think you misunderstand.

238
00:17:00,970 --> 00:17:03,010
My name is Luke Notos Greyrat.

239
00:17:03,610 --> 00:17:04,730
Notos Greyrat?

240
00:17:05,590 --> 00:17:10,610
Notos is Paul's branch of the family, so I guess that makes him my cousin.

241
00:17:10,610 --> 00:17:11,650
Hmph.

242
00:17:11,650 --> 00:17:15,010
He comes from Asura nobility.

243
00:17:16,450 --> 00:17:22,810
Although he is technically a student, his true purpose here is to act as a bodyguard for his liege princess Ariel, so...

244
00:17:22,810 --> 00:17:27,690
She's the second princess of the Asura kingdom, isn't she? I wonder what brought her here.

245
00:17:27,690 --> 00:17:34,610
I'm given to understand that she lost the struggle to become heir apparent to the throne and used her studies as a pretext to flee the country.

246
00:17:35,630 --> 00:17:38,970
